<Layout 
  title="UK Stamp Duty (SDLT) Explained: 2024 Buyer's Guide" 
  description="A complete mathematical breakdown of UK Stamp Duty Land Tax (SDLT). Learn the rates, first-time buyer relief, and how to calculate your bill."
